## Scope

This license covers the original code of this repository: the frontend
(`index.html`, `styles.css`, `js/midi.js`, `js/synth.js`, `js/pianoroll.js`,
`js/export.js`, `js/app.js`), `setup.sh`, and the GitHub Actions workflow.

It does **not** cover, and makes no claim over:

- **`msgs.wasm`** (built at deploy time from https://github.com/sloptainment/slopgs)
  -- a separate project with its own, unresolved licensing status. See
  README.md's "About the synth engine" section before reusing it elsewhere.
- **`gm.dls`** -- never included in this repository or its deployments; each
  user supplies their own, and it is never uploaded, stored, or redistributed
  by this project.
- **Vendored third-party code** in `js/vendor/` (lame.js, LGPL-3.0;
  libvorbis.js, BSD/Xiph.org) -- see `js/vendor/README.md`.
- **Fonts** in `fonts/` (IBM Plex Sans, Space Mono) -- both OFL-1.1, see
  `fonts/NOTICE.md`.
- **The demo MIDI files** in `demo/` -- CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, see `demo/CREDITS.md`.
